# Interoperability Architecture – Hospital EMR Ecosystem

Hospitals operate multiple clinical and administrative systems.
Interoperability enables controlled, secure data exchange.

## Typical Systems
- EMR / EHR
- HIS / Billing
- LIS
- PACS / RIS
- External labs, insurers, registries

## Architecture Principles
- Loose coupling between systems
- API-based integrations
- Event-driven data exchange
- Vendor-neutral interfaces

## Recommended Approach
- Use middleware / integration layers
- Avoid point-to-point integrations
- Maintain a canonical data model
